{"id":"C934fa2b1b1e956b25f1e","zh":"路基累积变形","en":"subgrade cumulative deformation","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","definition_zh":"路基在循环荷载作用下逐渐积累的变形。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于描述和预测反复列车荷载下路基变形的逐步积累，并分析其动力效应。关注的是卸载后不能完全恢复的变形及其长期发展。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C934fa2b1b1e956b25f1e","zh":"路基累积变形","en":"subgrade cumulative deformation","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"H170ea2578b9f8e8f23ed","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 李正等（2024）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D525812252d1c82a67ef9","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"路基累积变形"},{"id":"D2e1dcb170fc65253b290","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"subgrade cumulative deformation"}],"sources":{"P132":{"id":"P132","title":"车辆循环动载下高速铁路路基累积变形预测研究","authors":"李正,徐磊,王卫东,杜香刚,余志武,刘鹏飞,曾志平","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231073","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"李正等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-study-on-the-prediction-of-the-cumulative-deformation-of-high-speed-railway-subgrade-under-the-cycli"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S09d835c25ac010fedb7b","source_id":"P132","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"For the interaction of the two modules, after each cyclic jump, the subgrade cumulative deformation was mapped to the track system.","citations":[{"source_id":"P132","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S9e87c0cbb4a225d8f4f0","source_id":"P132","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"The results show that the calculation model presented in this paper can well reveal the evolution law of subgrade cumulative deformation under cyclic dynamic vehicular loads.","citations":[{"source_id":"P132","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S5c48a068672b71f3c63e","source_id":"P132","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"2 个模块的交互方面,在每次循环跳跃后,将路基累积变形空间映射至轨道,形成轨面附加几何不平顺,并同步更新迭代系统动力矩阵,建立了车致路基累积变形与系统动力响应之间的关联关系。","citations":[{"source_id":"P132","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S62da553fcd125f38bb03","source_id":"P132","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"研究结果表明:本文提出的计算模型可较好地揭示路基土体累积变形在循环车辆动载下的演化规律;采用循环跳跃的方法可更为真实准确地预测路基的累积变形,其计算的路基累积变形最大值为2.606 9 mm,而未采用循环跳跃方法计算出的累积变形最大值则为1.7 mm,低估了34.8%。","citations":[{"source_id":"P132","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C181f2417bb37ac20e6be","target_concept_id":"C181f2417bb37ac20e6be","target_zh":"累积变形","target_en":"cumulative deformation","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_concept_id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_zh":"动力响应","target_en":"dynamic responses","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cf610f01124d460ee3f9b","target_concept_id":"Cf610f01124d460ee3f9b","target_zh":"空间映射","target_en":"spatial mapping","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Ca67587bddad5cbdac15a","target_concept_id":"Ca67587bddad5cbdac15a","target_zh":"循环跳跃","target_en":"cycle jumping","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P132","title":"车辆循环动载下高速铁路路基累积变形预测研究","authors":"李正,徐磊,王卫东,杜香刚,余志武,刘鹏飞,曾志平","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231073","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"李正等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-study-on-the-prediction-of-the-cumulative-deformation-of-high-speed-railway-subgrade-under-the-cycli"}]}